{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "紹興府泰嶽久禪師　潭州石霜能禪師\n　　潭州雲蓋澄禪師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上機語未見"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "臨濟十一世楊岐四世"}
