{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十三人見錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "語見賢臣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "紹興府石佛奇禪師　蘄州三角劼禪師\n　　南康軍雲居祖禪師　寂庵主\n　　辯侍者"}
